[{"service":{"id":6392,"ident":"Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B","type":"serverless","vendor":"","region":"","compute":"","model":25754,"name":"Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B","remark":"Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B 是一款基于 Qwen3-VL 的 8B 参数 多模态嵌入（Embedding）模型，用于将文本、图像、截图等多种模态输入编码成语义向量，以支持高效跨模态检索、聚类和相似性计算。","price":0.0000,"props":{"name":"Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B","service_type":"serverless"},"inventories":0,"created_at":1768890052000,"updated_at":1768890101000,"sort_order":0,"status":1,"recommend":false,"cover":"https://gitee-ai.su.bcebos.com/v1/uploads/img/id-xegyngmvu-avatar-qwen.png","description_html":"<h3><span data-name=\"brain\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83E\uDDE0</span> <strong>模型简介：Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B</strong></h3><p><strong>Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B</strong> 是基于强大的 Qwen3-VL 多模态基础模型构建的 8 B 参数向量嵌入模型，可将文本、图像、截图、视频及其任意组合输入编码为高质量语义向量，支持跨模态语义对齐与相似性比较。</p><hr><h2><span data-name=\"star\" data-type=\"emoji\">⭐</span> <strong>模型特点</strong></h2><h3><span data-name=\"small_blue_diamond\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD39</span> 多模态支持</h3><p>能够对 <strong>文本、图像、截图及混合模态（如文本+图像）</strong> 输入生成统一语义向量，打破单一模态检索限制。</p><h3><span data-name=\"small_blue_diamond\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD39</span> 强语义表达</h3><p>采用 Qwen3-VL 底层架构，生成的嵌入向量在语义层面具有更丰富、更细粒度的表达，提升跨模态相似性计算与匹配准确性。</p><h3><span data-name=\"small_blue_diamond\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD39</span> 大规模参数（8B）</h3><p>8 B 参数规模赋予模型更强的理解能力与语义建模能力，适合对复杂场景、多语言环境下的语义检索任务进行高效支持。</p><h3><span data-name=\"small_blue_diamond\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD39</span> 多语言能力</h3><p>支持 <strong>30 多种语言</strong> 的统一向量表示，可满足全球化检索与跨语言检索需求。</p><h3><span data-name=\"small_blue_diamond\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD39</span> 可定制输出维度</h3><p>向量维度最高可达 <strong>4096</strong>，并支持用户自定义输出维度（如 64–4096），方便根据任务需求优化存储与检索效率。</p><h3><span data-name=\"small_blue_diamond\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD39</span> 超长上下文</h3><p>可处理长文本或组合内容的上下文长度高达 <strong>32k tokens</strong>，适用于大段内容的相似性比较与长文检索场景。</p><hr><h2><span data-name=\"rocket\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDE80</span> <strong>典型应用场景</strong></h2><h3><span data-name=\"mag\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDD0D</span> <strong>多模态检索系统</strong></h3><p>在搜索引擎或知识库中构建跨模态检索 pipelines，将用户查询（文本或图像）转化为向量，与数据库中的向量进行相似度匹配，支持精准检索。</p><h3><span data-name=\"robot\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83E\uDD16</span> <strong>搜索召回与排序增强</strong></h3><p>结合向量召回与重排序模型（如 Qwen3-VL-Reranker-8B）形成二阶段检索架构，提高检索结果排序质量与精确度。</p><h3><span data-name=\"books\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83D\uDCDA</span> <strong>聚类与组织内容</strong></h3><p>对大量文档、图像、视频等内容生成统一语义向量，可用于内容聚类、主题划分与信息组织。</p><h3><span data-name=\"brain\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83E\uDDE0</span> <strong>知识增强生成（RAG）</strong></h3><p>作为 RAG（检索增强生成）系统的召回组件，提供高质量嵌入向量作为上下文输入，提高下游生成任务的回答准确性与相关性。</p><h3><span data-name=\"globe_with_meridians\" data-type=\"emoji\">\uD83C\uDF10</span> <strong>跨语言语义检索</strong></h3><p>支持多语言语义表示，可以用于跨语种检索、翻译对齐、跨语义推荐等场景。</p>","visible":true,"purchasable":true,"access_scope":"PUBLIC","sale_mode":"one_time","tags":[{"id":1150,"name":"32K","slug":"context_size_32k","icon":"https://gitee-ai.su.bcebos.com/v1/uploads/img/tag-icons/id-f8crosrdk-id-y4z8cy4z9-context_size.png","en_name":"32K","color":"blue","description":"上下文大小","href":"","created_at":1734693847615,"sort_order":0,"categories":[{"id":31,"parent_id":28,"name":"Serverless服务标签","slug":"serverless-service-label","created_at":1728529387723,"icon":"","sort_order":31,"en_name":""}]},{"id":1196,"name":"向量化和重排","slug":"embedding-rerank","icon":"https://gitee-ai.su.bcebos.com/v1/tag-icons/serverless-feature-extraction.svg","en_name":"Embedding and Rerank","color":"","description":"","href":"","created_at":1741323767491,"sort_order":0,"categories":[{"id":30,"parent_id":28,"name":"Serverless服务","slug":"serverless-service","created_at":1728529387723,"icon":"","sort_order":30,"en_name":""}]},{"id":1223,"name":"4096 维","slug":"4096-dim","icon":"","en_name":"4096 dim","color":"","description":"","href":"","created_at":1749203697103,"sort_order":0,"categories":[{"id":31,"parent_id":28,"name":"Serverless服务标签","slug":"serverless-service-label","